{
    "title": "Clean It: Cleaning Games",
    "description": "\ud83e\uddfd<b>Welcome to Clean It: Cleaning Games, the ultimate cleaning games experience where cleanliness is key to a tidy success!</b>\ud83e\uddfdDive into the world of restaurant clean up management as you embark on a journey to build, clean up and expand your very own eatery.\r\n\r\nTidy up the cluttered rooms, do some carpet cleaning, clear away trash, and lay the foundation for your dream restaurant. As you progress, unlock cash registers, food stands, and tables to attract customers and boost your earnings. It's important to do the cleanup after each customer to get that profit!\r\n\r\nBut Clean It: Cleaning Games is not just about making money and clean up \u2013 maintaining a clean and tidy life is crucial. Hire servers to keep the tables clean and tidy and ensure your patrons have a pleasant dining experience. Be vigilant in collecting garbage to keep your establishment spotless and customers satisfied. Carpet cleaning and cleaning dirt is crucial in keeping your business going - power wash the floors, clean the beach, and keep a tidy life!\r\n\r\nAs your cleanup profits grow, so too can your restaurant. Unlock new rooms to clean up and expand your tycoon games business empire, upgrade your character for cleaning games and servers to increase cleanup capacity and efficiency, from tables to carpet cleaning, and watch as your restaurant profits soar. In the world of cleaning games, Clean It: Cleaning Games brings you a unique cleaning , restaurant and business management and tycoon experience!\r\n\r\nGame Features\r\n\ud83e\uddf9\ufe0fRestaurant Games expansion: clean up new rooms to get more cash and customers! Cleaning games get expanded here, expand, cleanup, become a restaurant tycoon.\r\n\ud83c\udf7dUpgrade your business: set tables, tidy up, open bars and deliver food for faster carpet cleaning and cleanup process\r\n\u2728Hire staff: employ cleaners to keep everything clean and tidy, from tables to carpet cleaning - make sure you upgrade them for the greatest cleanup capacity!\r\n\r\n\r\nClean it restaurant cleanup offers these cleaning game features and much more! Unlock new rooms to cleanup, look after the carpet cleaning and make your restaurant larger, tidy up everything and become a restaurant tycoon\r\n\r\nCarpet cleaning, floor and tables, cleaning games requires you to have a tidy mind and a restaurant tycoon eye\r\n\r\nWith addictive clean up gameplay, charming graphics, and endless possibilities for expansion and cleanup like carpet cleaning, Clean It: Cleaning Games offers hours of entertainment for all players who enjoy working games and cleaning games. Are you ready to roll up your sleeves, cleanup, do some carpet cleaning, and build the restaurant of your dreams? Download Clean It now and let the cleaning games frenzy begin! Get ready for the cleanup.",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83e\uddfd<b>Welcome to Clean It: Cleaning Games, the ultimate cleaning games experience where cleanliness is key to a tidy success!</b>\ud83e\uddfdDive into the world of restaurant clean up management as you embark on a journey to build, clean up and expand your very own eatery.<br><br>Tidy up the cluttered rooms, do some carpet cleaning, clear away trash, and lay the foundation for your dream restaurant. As you progress, unlock cash registers, food stands, and tables to attract customers and boost your earnings. It&#39;s important to do the cleanup after each customer to get that profit!<br><br>But Clean It: Cleaning Games is not just about making money and clean up \u2013 maintaining a clean and tidy life is crucial. Hire servers to keep the tables clean and tidy and ensure your patrons have a pleasant dining experience. Be vigilant in collecting garbage to keep your establishment spotless and customers satisfied. Carpet cleaning and cleaning dirt is crucial in keeping your business going - power wash the floors, clean the beach, and keep a tidy life!<br><br>As your cleanup profits grow, so too can your restaurant. Unlock new rooms to clean up and expand your tycoon games business empire, upgrade your character for cleaning games and servers to increase cleanup capacity and efficiency, from tables to carpet cleaning, and watch as your restaurant profits soar. In the world of cleaning games, Clean It: Cleaning Games brings you a unique cleaning , restaurant and business management and tycoon experience!<br><br>Game Features<br>\ud83e\uddf9\ufe0fRestaurant Games expansion: clean up new rooms to get more cash and customers! Cleaning games get expanded here, expand, cleanup, become a restaurant tycoon.<br>\ud83c\udf7dUpgrade your business: set tables, tidy up, open bars and deliver food for faster carpet cleaning and cleanup process<br>\u2728Hire staff: employ cleaners to keep everything clean and tidy, from tables to carpet cleaning - make sure you upgrade them for the greatest cleanup capacity!<br><br><br>Clean it restaurant cleanup offers these cleaning game features and much more! Unlock new rooms to cleanup, look after the carpet cleaning and make your restaurant larger, tidy up everything and become a restaurant tycoon<br><br>Carpet cleaning, floor and tables, cleaning games requires you to have a tidy mind and a restaurant tycoon eye<br><br>With addictive clean up gameplay, charming graphics, and endless possibilities for expansion and cleanup like carpet cleaning, Clean It: Cleaning Games offers hours of entertainment for all players who enjoy working games and cleaning games. Are you ready to roll up your sleeves, cleanup, do some carpet cleaning, and build the restaurant of your dreams? Download Clean It now and let the cleaning games frenzy begin! Get ready for the cleanup.",
